    "sentence_translations": [
      "How Do I Get Home?",
      "",
      "There was a man who went to the doctor. He asked the doctor if there were any good methods for weight loss.",
      "",
      "The doctor said, “Eat more fruits and vegetables, and walk five kilometers every day after dinner.",
      "Call me back after three months.”",
      "",
      "After three months, the man called the doctor and said, “I have good news for you! I am no longer overweight.”",
      "",
      "The doctor was very happy and said, “That’s great!”",
      "",
      "Then the man continued, “But right now I am more than 500 kilometers away. How do I get home?”"
    ]
